        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E4-0 Sonoma Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Sonoma deadbolt is designed with the natural elegance of wine country in mind. The uncommon square shape is a pleasant departure from the ordinary. It is available as either a single or a double cylinder deadbolt; and both meet ANSI 156.5 grade 2 criteria. Available in antique pewter, oil rubbed bronze and medium bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion E4 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Square Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</liI>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder</b> -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder</b> - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
